heard a quack shouting:

"New improved printer filter todayyyy, a dozen $0" ;-)
-------------------------------------------------------------

The name of the game:

	"apsfilter-1.11 - *less* bugs *same* features ;->"

A last minute hack - simply adding $PATH at the end of the 
