Subject: Microsoft Busmouse mini-HOWTO
Message-ID: <1994Mar23.182737.4796@cs.cornell.edu>
Followup-To: comp.os.linux.misc
Keywords: Microsoft busmouse mini-HOWTO
Sender: mdw@cs.cornell.edu (Matt Welsh)
