fixes all bugs that were reported to me.  Details are in the README
file in the distribution.

Please read the README file before using vlock.  Really -- it does
explain some important things.

If you got vlock 0.5, I suggest getting vlock 0.6.  There was one
significant bug in the earlier version; on some setups, SIGQUIT, which
can be delivered from the keyboard with <CTRL>-\, would kill
vlock.  This should now be fixed.

