This is the first of several planned releases of "personalities" of the  
Andrew User Interface System (aka ATK).  This is based on the latest public  
code from the Andrew Consortium.  This release focuses on the editor, ez,  
as a word processor.  The tar file is 1.5MB and expands to only 4.5MB (a  
full release is about 40MB).  EZ isn't good enough to do your thesis I  
suspect, but you can certainly do lesser projects very well with it.  The  
dynamic objects that are included include image and raster to allow you to  
include images in your documents.  Watch for other packages of auis62L* at  
sunsite in the coming weeks.  Hope you find this as useful as I do.   
Questions and comments to me or c.o.l.*.
						Terry Gliedt

