I have uploaded version 1.2 of GMOD to sunsite.unc.edu.  It should be
available as gmod-1.2.tar.gz in either /pub/Linux/Incoming or
/pub/Linux/apps/sound.

GMOD is a MOD/669/ULT/MTM file player for Linux and the Gravis Ultrasound
card.

New features of this version include:

	- An option to disable BPM tempos
	- Ability to play compressed or gzipped modules
	- Meaningful exit codes
	- 669 effects
	- Removal of duplicate tracks to reduce memory consumption
	- Bug fixes

Please send any suggestions, bug reports, etc. to Andrew J. Robinson
(robinson@cnj.digex.com)


