Announce of

        djscript 1.3

A text formatter for HP DeskJet series printers.
Known to work with DJ500, DJ550C, DJ510. (DJ500C should be ok too.)

Uploaded on Mon, Mar 14 1994:

        sunsite.unc.edu (/pub/Linux/system/Printing)

        djscript.1.3.tar.gz
        djscript.1.3.lsm

It supports:

        --  multicolumn output
        --  logical pages
        --  adjustment of printer (character set, font, size,
            orientation, etc.) via commandline options

